<title>UK: TABLE-Allders H1 pretax profit doubles.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Allders H1 pretax profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		15.0		   vs 3.8</p>
